<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bk sets warrants on China Travel.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bk sets warrants on China Travel.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London Branch, said it priced on Friday 695 million American style warrants on shares of China Travel International Investment Hong Kong Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$3.645	 PREMIUM	   17 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.1094	GEARING	   3.7x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  17.DEC.97	BOARD LOT	 20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	LISTING DATE    19.FEB.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$4.05	  PAY DATE	  17.FEB.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  PHYSICAL DELIVERY ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
